    <string name="app_name">Play On Connect</string>
    <string name="header_description">Create Rules to play an Action on an Event (Android 9+):\n- Triggers: on bluetooth device connected, on time ("alarm").\n- Actions: play music file(s), open a website url e.g. youtube.\n- Rules with the same bluetooth device play in parallel.\n- All time based rules play in parallel (you can layer tracks with start offsets).</string>

